  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 18583904256
    m_Localized: How to do replay?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6658750144512
    m_Localized: Press "~" to open console and type "debug record 1" to enable replay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6681353248768
    m_Localized: Then load into the game and open the menu click <b>start recording</b>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7216886177792
    m_Localized: Then  its gonna start, to stop you can go back to menu or simply
      click <b>stop recording</b>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15122612346880
    m_Localized: Finally you can go back to Menu -> Replay to see those replay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
